# GMS offers it as a window the player presses in during other swings; the fight
# has no such windows, so the cooldown is what paces it.
#
# Twelve strikes twice, not twenty-four: GMS states a Strike Count beside the
# attack count.
#
# The client has no hitbox for it, so the stated ten stands.
